  m_Name: Quest_Lira
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  initialDialog:
  - "Mmph\u2014! Oh! Hello there!"
  - 'Are you good with puzzles? '
  - I was helping a sickly fellow gather winter herbs when a wind spirit blew through
    and made a mess of everything.
  - Now the gate to the cold woods is sealed
  - If you can realign the roots, the forest will open her path to you. Will you
    try?
  acceptOption: "I\u2019ll give it a try!"
  acceptAnswer: Really! Thank you! If you can realign the roots, the forest will
    open her path to you!
  declineOption: "I\u2019ll try to come back..."
  declineAnswer: Very well. Come back when your paws feel sure.
  comebackAfterDecline: "Changed your mind? The gate won\u2019t open itself, and
    I can\u2019t coax the roots into place alone."
  comebackInProgress: Oh you're back. The roots are still tangled, you know. The
    forest waits, patient but cold.
  comebackCompleted: "You did it! That\u2019s the \r\nforest\u2019s energy flowing
    again.\r\n"
  finalWords: "Follow the frost carefully. \r\nThe Winter Forest is quiet, but never
    empty."
